<div class="page">
  <div class="center-column">
    <p class="large-text">
      Free and open source web application for <span>issue and task</span> management
    </p>

    <p class="medium-text">
      The backend is
      <a href="https://rubyonrails.org/" target="_blank">Ruby on Rails</a>
      and uses
      <a href="https://docs.ruby-lang.org/en/master/ERB.html" target="_blank">ERB</a>,
      <a href="https://sass-lang.com/" target="_blank">SCSS</a> compiled to CSS, and
      vanilla
      <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript" target="_blank">JavaScript</a>.
      In addition, it uses
      <a href="https://turbo.hotwired.dev/" target="_blank">Turbo</a> to make HTTP
      requests quicker.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="large-links">
    <a href="https://github.com/dsandstrom/task_roller" target="_blank">
      <div class="logo-wrapper">
        <%= icon("fork-repo") %>
      </div>
      <p>Source Code</p>
    </a>

    <a href="https://production.task-roller.net" target="_blank">
      <div class="logo-wrapper">
        <%= icon("globe") %>
      </div>
      <p>App in Action</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
